| `restart-after-checkpoint` | durable | control: resumed | resumed | committed at queued when the process was stopped … | committed at validating when the process was stop… |
| `duplicate-delivery` | baseline | control: single delivery | doubled | the same enquiry delivered once (the control) | the same enquiry delivered twice |
| `duplicate-delivery` | durable | control: single delivery | doubled | the same enquiry delivered once (the control) | the same enquiry delivered twice |
| `concurrent-clients` | baseline | control: not corrupted | not corrupted | two enquiries submitted one after the other (the … | two enquiries in flight together |
| `concurrent-clients` | durable | control: not corrupted | not corrupted | two enquiries submitted one after the other (the … | two enquiries in flight together |
